Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 743 "[Lemegeton] Gate of Devildom"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900261000
    Collect 1 of 900262000

Requires (player level >= 73 and player is karus and quest 741 is completed) or (player level >= 73 and player is elmorad and quest 742 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "I'm glad our men's morale went up. Go to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] and he'll give you your next mission."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I'm glad our men's morale went up. Go to Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] and he'll give you your next mission."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [29Devil] Astaroth and [53Devil] Camio."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [29Devil] Astaroth and [53Devil] Camio."

On in_progress
    Say "Where is the seal Scroll?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. With this seal Scroll, the soul of devil will be locked in this ring."

On completed
    Say "The war is still in our enemy's favor but there's stil a hope. We must eliminate and seal [17Devil] Botis who controls 26 troops and his followers [41Devil] Focalor and [63Devil] Andras."
